Nirca Mini WebGPU chat

The code in this file and repository was written for Nirca and is under the
MIT License below. No part of it is taken from the Ternary Bonsai WebGPU space
(huggingface.co/spaces/webml-community/bonsai-ternary-webgpu), which served
only as an example of the idea.

The model's forward pass and decoding follow Nirca's implementation, which is
ported from mini-AGI (https://github.com/volotat/mini-AGI), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Alexey Borsky; its notice is reproduced at the end.

The model weights are distributed separately and are not covered by this
license; see where they are published.

